  "id": "procrustes-analysis",
  "term": "Procrustes analysis",
  "definition": "Procrustes analysis, in this packet, refers to an orthogonal fitting method used within dictionary learning to update grouped dictionary elements so they better match training data and reduce reconstruction error. It is presented as part of an alternating, iterative approach for improving sparse representations.",
